# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# The root image's own packages from Arch Linux ARM, installed first
# (tools/build-rootfs). Omarchy's list comes next, from the omarchy package
# itself (install/omarchy-base.packages, minus packages.omarchy-skip), then
# Omarchy Mobile's (packages.omamobile). One name per line; # comments.
base
sudo
openssh
networkmanager
ufw
iptables-nft
sddm
e2fsprogs
kmod
python
polkit
pciutils
usbutils
less
# Mali-G710 CSF firmware for panthor (arm/mali/arch10.8), GPU-PLAN
linux-firmware-other
wireless-regdb
# Arch Linux ARM's package signing keys (base pulls only Arch's)
archlinuxarm-keyring
# Omarchy itself, from [omarchy] (Omarchy's stable channel)
omarchy-keyring
omarchy
omarchy-settings
# Voice dictation out of the box (packages/omamobile-shell README, Voice
# input): Voxtype from [omarchy], what Install > AI > Dictation adds. Here,
# not in packages.omamobile, which takes [omamobile] packages only.
voxtype-bin
